<h1 class="h3">Privacy policy</h1>
<p class="text-body-secondary">Last updated <?= e(date('j F Y', filemtime(__FILE__))) ?>. Operated by <?= e(setting('brand.company')) ?> (<?= e(setting('brand.support_email')) ?>).</p>
<h2 class="h6">What we collect</h2>
<ul><li>Account: name, email, password (stored only as a secure hash), date of birth.</li><li>Profile details you choose to add (college, budget, lifestyle, photo). Gender and age are optional and hidden by default.</li><li>Verification: college email, or an uploaded document that is <strong>deleted right after review</strong>.</li><li>Messages, listings, enquiries, swipes, reports and blocks.</li><li>Security data: sign-in times, IP address and an audit log of sensitive actions.</li></ul>
<h2 class="h6">How we use it</h2>
<ul><li>To show you compatible students and listings, and run chat.</li><li>To keep the platform safe: preventing fraud, reviewing reports, enforcing rules.</li><li>To send account emails (verification codes, password resets, important notices). No marketing emails without consent.</li></ul>
<h2 class="h6">What others see</h2>
<p>Other students see only your display name, photo and the profile fields you allow. We never show your email, phone, full name, date of birth, documents or a listing's exact address (shared only after you accept an enquiry).</p>
<h2 class="h6">Who can access it</h2>
<p>Moderators access data only when reviewing a report or verification; document views are logged. We do not sell personal data. Hosting and email providers process data on our behalf.</p>
<h2 class="h6">Your rights</h2>
<p>You can edit your profile, hide from discovery, download your data, and delete your account from <em>Account & privacy</em>. Deletion hides your profile immediately; data is erased after a 7-day grace period, except limited records we must keep for an open safety investigation or by law.</p>
<h2 class="h6">Retention</h2>
<p>Unverified sign-ups are removed after 14 days; one-time codes expire in 10 minutes; security logs are kept for audit purposes.</p>
